OL,3,GNEWSADuran Duran guitarist Andy Taylor 
OL,4,Adies aged 65                           
OL,6,FAndy Taylor, the guitarist for the pop 
OL,7,Fgroup Duran Duran, has died at the age 
OL,8,Fof 65.                                 
OL,10,FBorn in Tynemouth, he co-wrote some of 
OL,11,Fthe group's biggest hits, including    
OL,12,FSave A Prayer, Rio and Girls On Film;  
OL,13,Fand also worked with artists like      
OL,14,FRobert Palmer, Rod Stewart and Belinda 
OL,15,FCarlisle.                              
OL,17,FIn a statement, his bandmates said     
OL,18,FTaylor had fought "a long and          
OL,19,Fcourageous battle with prostate cancer"
OL,20,Fand "passed away peacefully at home,   
OL,21,Fsurrounded by his family, on Monday 23 
OL,22,FNovember".                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
